        "fy2025_source_quote": "\"Homeownership - 2025 Fiscal Year\" county table, TOTALS row: Total # Purchased Loans 6,643, Total $ Purchased Loans $1,458,750,346.00, Total # K-FIT 4,222, Total $ K-FIT $47,813,854.92, Total # Advantage 65, Total $ Advantage $353,623.00, Total # PENNVEST 102, Total $ PENNVEST $2,374,895.00. K-FIT/Advantage/PENNVEST are down-payment/closing-cost assistance loans layered on top of a SUBSET of the 6,643 purchase loans (a homebuyer receives at most one of the three), not a partition of the full 6,643 -- most purchase loans close with no PHFA-sourced second-mortgage assistance.",
